NfoC","wage_unit_cn":"元/月","months":12,"is_negotiable":true,"education":"115VXVUi","education_cn":"博士","experience":"113upZvj","experience_cn":"经验不限","is_graduates":true,"major":["115ZTcrL.114UERok"],"major_cn":["机械设计制造类"],"department":84892,"department_cn":"煤炭检测中心","start_time":"2026-05-31 15:00:00","end_time":"2026-12-31 17:00:00","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000.110000.110100.110105","area_cn":"北京-朝阳区","address":"和平街青年沟东路5号煤炭科学技术研究院有限公司","house_number":"1号楼","country":"000000","province":"110000","city":"110100","district":"110105"}],"contents":"【岗位职责】\n1. 主导智能检测装备配套AI算法、机器视觉、数据建模研发，攻克检测精度、自动化运行等核心技术难题。并可主导多模态具身交互算法设计与研发，结合大模型完成模型开发、编码与迭代优化。\n2. 攻坚具身智能等核心技术，完成算法仿真与真机测试，持续提升交互自然度与响应性能，推动交互算法在人形机器人平台完成落地与适配。推进AI技术与检测装备深度融合，完成相关核心产品样机调试、功能优化，推动技术成果量产及市场化应用落地。\n3. 跟踪行业前沿技术动态，统筹人工智能、多模态交互智慧实验室技术相关标准、专利、软著等知识产权的梳理、布局与申报。\n4. 对接高校、科研院所开展产学研合作，联动集团内部业务部门，解决智能检测装备及多模态智慧实验室技术应用各类问题。\n5. 跟踪领域前沿技术趋势，开展新技术预研与方案论证，梳理技术风险，攻克复杂实景下的人工智能及多模态具身交互难题。\n\n【任职条件】\n1. 具有全日制博士研究生学历，拥有5年以上多模态或具身智能算法研发实战经验。\n2. 年龄40周岁以下，拥有重大技术成果，资深管理经验的优秀人才，年龄要求可适当放宽。具有主持国家级、省部级项目的经验。具有高级职称者优先。\n3. 精通深度学习、机器视觉、工业数据建模，可独立完成智能检测装备AI架构设计与算法开发，并精通多模态特征融合、自然语言处理、计算机视觉技术，熟练运用PyTorch、TensorFlow、ROS等主流开发框架。\n4. 深入研究大模型与具身智能融合技术，有机器人多模态交互项目落地经历，能独立完成算法全流程研发工作。\n5. 具备数据集构建、算法评测能力，有领域顶会/期刊论文、交互相关发明专利成果者，优先予以考虑录用。\n6. 逻辑严谨，具备独立技术攻关能力，沟通协作能力良好，可协同多团队解决复杂场景下的各类技术问题。\n\n【招聘对象】\n高校应届毕业生或社会人员","template":"default","status":1,"is_apply":true,"apply_instruction":"","is_charge":false,"charge_amount":0,"contact_user":{"id":"","im_id":"","name":"","show_avatar":""},"user_id":"8e7ded8bd91841648574701498351616","subsite":0,"notes":"","extend":"","refresh_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:52","create_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:52","update_time":"2026-05-31 13:40:19","offline_type":1,"company_info":{"name":"煤炭科学技术研究院有限公司","show_name":"煤炭科学技术研究院有限公司","nature":"11AzDak","nature_cn":"国企","industry":"114zFMRK","industry_cn":"科学研究和技术服务业","scale":"112Qy915","scale_cn":"1000-2000人","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000.110000.110100.110105","area_cn":"中国-北京-北京市-朝阳区","address":"北京市朝阳区和平街青年沟路5号","country":"000000","province":"110000","city":"110100","district":"110105"}],"logo":"6486b5946013614e7f49d423","show_logo":"https://iguopin-company.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/10685324692630930/logo/20230612/9a293cd51cf12e0c857dbdf73dc01083.jpg","special_url":"","company_credit":null,"friendly":null},"is_favorite":false,"applied":2,"applied_num":0,"group":null,"recruitment_process":"","hide":0,"project_config":{"job_apply_count":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_apply_count","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2},"job_description_template":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_description_template","param":"common","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"common\"}","tip":"","status":1},"job_display":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_display","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2}},"index":"iguopin","tag_group_code_cn":null,"company_esg":null},{"job_id":"202821236760249009","job_name":"大数据技术工程师","company_id":"10685472470246736","company_name":"中煤科工集团新疆研究院有限公司","recruitment_type":"115amZVP","recruitment_type_cn":"社会招聘","nature":"113Fc6wc","nature_cn":"社招","category":"113nmV1c.1165gS3E.116MgGs7","category_cn":"人工智能研发高级经理","amount":1,"min_wage":0,"max_wage":0,"wage_unit":"11jNfoC","wage_unit_cn":"元/月","months":12,"is_negotiable":true,"education":"115VXVUi","education_cn":"博士","experience":"113upZvj","experience_cn":"经验不限","is_graduates":true,"major":["117CvKmE.11MXas7"],"major_cn":["计算机类"],"industry":["113Dd81T.117JFwsG"],"industry_cn":["数据服务"],"department":0,"department_cn":"新疆研究院","start_time":"2026-05-31 15:00:00","end_time":"2026-12-31 17:00:00","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000.650000.650100.650106","area_cn":"乌鲁木齐-头屯河区","address":"新疆乌鲁木齐市经济技术开发区（头屯河区）维泰南路396号煤科大厦","house_number":"15层","country":"000000","province":"650000","city":"650100","district":"650106"}],"contents":"【岗位职责】\n1.数据采集与治理：负责煤矿井下传感器、监测系统、自动化设备（如采煤机、液压支架、通风系统、定位装置）等多源异构数据的采集、清洗、存储与标准化处理。构建井下数据库/数据仓，设计高可用、低延迟的工业大数据架构，保障数据质量与安全。\n2.分析与建模：运用机器、软件的学习、时间序列分析、图算法等技术，建立瓦斯浓度、矿压、通风、设备故障预测等模型，提升井下风险预警能力与生产效率。开发智能调度、人员定位轨迹分析、能耗优化等数据应用方案，支撑矿山智能化决策。\n3.平台与工具开发：搭建煤矿井下边缘计算+云协同的大数据处理平台，实现实时数据处理与离线分析。设计数据可视化系统（如数字孪生界面），辅助生产指挥与应急管理。\n4.跨系统协作：与采矿工程、安全工程、自动化团队协作，将数据成果转化为井下可行的作业规程或预警机制。主导或参与煤矿智能化标准制定、技术专利与论文申报。\n5.智能化运维：熟悉矿山各类智能化平台系统的开发，可根据现场需要，进行矿山应用平台、AI大模型的安装部署及调试，以及平台运行期间的运维和管理。\n\n【任职条件】\n1.学历与专业：博士研究生学历，计算机科学与技术、数据科学、人工智能或相关专业。\n2.工作经验：具备工业大数据领域实际项目经验，其中涉及矿山、隧道、油气田等地下或恶劣环境数据应用场景优秀、有主导过工业物联网数据平台建设或预测性维护模型落地者优先。侧重井下复杂环境下的数据工程化落地能力，要求兼顾学术深度与工业场景的工程适配性。\n3.技术能力：精通Hadoop/Spark生态，熟悉时序数据库（如TDengine、InfluxDB）及MQTT/OPC UA等工业协议。掌握Python/Scala/Java，熟练使用TensorFlow/PyTorch进行机器学习建模。了解井下通信网络（如5G、Wi-Fi6、UWB定位）及煤矿安全监控系统（如KJ95X）者加分。\n4.综合素质：能适应煤矿井下实地工作需求（需持有或能考取煤矿安全资格证书）。具备强抗压能力、跨学科沟通能力及技术创新敏感性。\n5.证书要求：注册数据工程师（CDA）、AWS/Azure数据工程师认证、煤矿安全相关培训证书为加分项。\n6.工作地点：煤炭基地研发中心+定期井下作业。\n\n【招聘对象】\n高校应届毕业生或社会人员","template":"default","status":1,"is_apply":true,"apply_instruction":"","is_charge":false,"charge_amount":0,"contact_user":{"id":"","im_id":"","name":"","show_avatar":""},"user_id":"8e7ded8bd91841648574701498351616","subsite":0,"notes":"","extend":"","refresh_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:58","create_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:58","update_time":"2026-05-31 13:37:32","offline_type":1,"company_info":{"name":"中煤科工集团新疆研究院有限公司","show_name":"新疆研究院","nature":"11AzDak","nature_cn":"国企","industry":"114zFMRK.117AeWkB","industry_cn":"科技推广和应用服务业","scale":"117Ng4GL","scale_cn":"100-300人","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000","area_cn":"中国","country":"000000"}],"logo":"66c29928409095d9ab82862a","show_logo":"https://iguopin-company.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/10685472470246736/logo/20240819/108577484395511985.jpg","special_url":"","company_credit":null,"friendly":null},"is_favorite":false,"applied":2,"applied_num":0,"group":null,"recruitment_process":"","hide":0,"project_config":{"job_apply_count":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_apply_count","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2},"job_description_template":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_description_template","param":"common","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"common\"}","tip":"","status":1},"job_display":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_display","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2}},"index":"iguopin","tag_group_code_cn":null,"company_esg":null},{"job_id":"202821236441481905","job_name":"具身智能算法工程师","company_id":"10685387167375472","company_name":"中煤科工机器人科技有限公司","recruitment_type":"115amZVP","recruitment_type_cn":"社会招聘","nature":"113Fc6wc","nature_cn":"社招","category":"113nmV1c.1165gS3E.116E2kj3","category_cn":"机器人算法","amount":2,"min_wage":0,"max_wage":0,"wage_unit":"11jNfoC","wage_unit_cn":"元/月","months":12,"is_negotiable":true,"education":"115VXVUi","education_cn":"博士","experience":"113upZvj","experience_cn":"经验不限","is_graduates":true,"major":["116eJJ16.117Nqszy"],"major_cn":["计算机类"],"department":0,"department_cn":"中煤科工机器人科技有限公司","start_time":"2026-05-31 15:00:00","end_time":"2026-12-31 17:00:00","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000.210000.210100.210112","area_cn":"沈阳-浑南区","country":"000000","province":"210000","city":"210100","district":"210112"}],"contents":"【岗位职责】\n1.负责具身智能算法研发，提升煤矿机器人在井下非结构化环境中的自主感知、决策与控制能力。\n2.研究视觉、激光雷达、惯性、力觉、触觉等多模态融合感知技术，解决低照度、高粉尘、潮湿等恶劣条件下的环境理解问题。\n3.构建机器人与煤矿典型场景（巷道、斜坡、狭窄空间）的物理交互模型，优化煤矿特种机器人井下行走、越障与精细操作性能。\n4.开发基于强化学习/模仿学习的具身策略，实现机器人对井下特殊环境的快速适应。\n5.完成算法在嵌入式平台（如Jetson、瑞芯微）的部署与整机联调，满足实时性及防爆适配要求。\n6.参与井下现场测试与迭代，收集数据并优化算法性能，解决感知失效、控制失调、通信受限等工程问题。\n7.跟踪前沿技术（如大模型、具身决策模型）并推动其在煤矿机器人中的转化应用。\n8.指导技术团队，协助申报科研项目及行业标准。\n\n【任职条件】\n1.已获得或即将获得机器人、人工智能、控制、自动化等相关专业博士学位。\n2.博士期间研究方向为具身智能、移动机器人自主导航、机械臂柔顺控制、多模态感知、强化学习/模仿学习在机器人中的应用等，且具有实际机器人平台开发经验。\n3.熟练掌握C++/Python，具备ROS/ROS2实际项目开发经验；熟悉常见算法（如SLAM、运动规划、状态估计等）。\n4.熟悉PyTorch深度学习框架，有模型训练与嵌入式端部署经验。\n5.了解煤矿或类似恶劣工业环境（低照度、高粉尘、易燃易爆、无GPS）对机器人带来的额外约束（如防爆要求、通信受限、算力受限），并能在算法设计中予以考虑。\n6.有至少一次完整参与的机器人系统从算法开发到真实环境测试的经验，具备现场问题分析与快速迭代能力。\n7.在机器人、人工智能领域国际期刊或会议发表过至少2篇高质量论文，或拥有相关发明专利授权。\n8.有煤矿/矿山、地下工程、危险环境机器人项目经验者优先；具备防爆知识或安标认证经验者优先。\n\n【招聘对象】\n高校应届毕业生或社会人员","template":"default","status":1,"is_apply":true,"apply_instruction":"","is_charge":false,"charge_amount":0,"contact_user":{"id":"","im_id":"","name":"","show_avatar":""},"user_id":"8e7ded8bd91841648574701498351616","subsite":0,"notes":"","extend":"","refresh_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:58","create_time":"2026-05-31 12:47:58","update_time":"2026-05-31 13:37:32","offline_type":1,"company_info":{"name":"中煤科工机器人科技有限公司","show_name":"中煤科工机器人科技有限公司","nature":"11AzDak","nature_cn":"国企","industry":"115WQjYb","industry_cn":"制造业","scale":"112JjHq4","scale_cn":"300-500人","district_list":[{"area_code":"000000.440000.440300","area_cn":"中国-广东省-深圳市","address":"深圳市南山区软件产业基地4栋A座902室","country":"000000","province":"440000","city":"440300"}],"logo":"6482dc1f42d5e5c8cf85f388","show_logo":"https://iguopin-company.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/10685387167375472/logo/20230609/af8081f8c51121c784e5a3345bd877f1.png","special_url":"","company_credit":null,"friendly":null},"is_favorite":false,"applied":2,"applied_num":0,"group":null,"recruitment_process":"","hide":0,"project_config":{"job_apply_count":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_apply_count","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2},"job_description_template":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_description_template","param":"common","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"common\"}","tip":"","status":1},"job_display":{"id":0,"project_id":"202565266708628031","type":"job_display","param":"","content":"{\"tip\": \"\", \"param\": \"\"}","tip":"","status":2}},"index":"iguopin","tag_group_code_cn":null,"company_esg":null}]},"trace":"605890798a1b74759ae83b2a6b17f761"}